{"lineas": [{"at": 0.25, "clip": "clip_67091c58e21e4f33ba07", "texto": "¿Sabes cuántas veces explota tu motor en un segundo? Vamos a abrirlo.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.12, 0.52], ["cuántas", 0.52, 0.92], ["veces", 0.92, 1.24], ["explota", 1.24, 1.72], ["tu", 1.72, 1.8], ["motor", 1.8, 2.12], ["en", 2.2, 2.2], ["un", 2.2, 2.36], ["segundo", 2.36, 2.92], ["Vamos", 2.943, 3.2], ["a", 3.28, 3.28], ["abrirlo", 3.28, 3.76]]}, {"at": 4.5, "clip": "clip_55fd7f18ca2e4f268607", "texto": "Esto es un cilindro por dentro. El pistón baja y entra aire con gasolina: admisión. Sube y lo aprieta: compresión.", "words": [["Esto", 0.12, 0.36], ["es", 0.36, 0.52], ["un", 0.52, 0.6], ["cilindro", 0.6, 1.08], ["por", 1.08, 1.32], ["dentro", 1.32, 1.77], ["El", 1.776, 1.94], ["pistón", 1.94, 2.34], ["baja", 2.34, 2.82], ["y", 2.82, 2.98], ["entra", 2.98, 3.38], ["aire", 3.38, 3.54], ["con", 3.54, 3.7], ["gasolina", 3.7, 4.34], ["admisión", 4.359, 5.15], ["Sube", 5.195, 5.6], ["y", 5.6, 5.76], ["lo", 5.84, 5.84], ["aprieta", 5.84, 6.4], ["compresión", 6.448, 7.33]]}, {"at": 12.3, "clip": "clip_25d69a3f2c534850ae3d", "texto": "Salta la chispa de la bujía, la mezcla explota y empuja el pistón hacia abajo. Al subir otra vez, saca los gases: escape.", "words": [["Salta", 0.119, 0.52], ["la", 0.6, 0.6], ["chispa", 0.6, 0.92], ["de", 0.92, 1.08], ["la", 1.08, 1.16], ["bujía", 1.16, 1.64], ["la", 1.71, 1.81], ["mezcla", 1.81, 2.21], ["explota", 2.21, 2.85], ["y", 2.85, 3.01], ["empuja", 3.01, 3.33], ["el", 3.33, 3.41], ["pistón", 3.41, 3.73], ["hacia", 3.73, 3.97], ["abajo", 3.97, 4.4], ["Al", 4.447, 4.53], ["subir", 4.53, 4.85], ["otra", 4.85, 5.01], ["vez", 5.01, 5.24], ["saca", 5.252, 5.65], ["los", 5.65, 5.81], ["gases", 5.81, 6.29], ["escape", 6.445, 6.93]]}, {"at": 19.7, "clip": "clip_bd4a03859d16442581c2", "texto": "La biela convierte ese sube y baja en giro del cigüeñal, y de ahí a las ruedas. Cuatro tiempos, dos vueltas.", "words": [["La", 0.119, 0.28], ["biela", 0.28, 0.6], ["convierte", 0.6, 1.16], ["ese", 1.16, 1.4], ["sube", 1.4, 1.72], ["y", 1.8, 1.8], ["baja", 1.8, 2.2], ["en", 2.2, 2.28], ["giro", 2.28, 2.6], ["del", 2.6, 2.76], ["cigüeñal", 2.76, 3.32], ["y", 3.389, 3.55], ["de", 3.55, 3.63], ["ahí", 3.63, 3.95], ["a", 3.95, 4.03], ["las", 4.03, 4.19], ["ruedas", 4.19, 4.75], ["Cuatro", 4.75, 5.11], ["tiempos", 5.11, 5.74], ["dos", 5.77, 6.09], ["vueltas", 6.09, 6.65]]}, {"at": 26.9, "clip": "clip_bfdf058f2f6f4481b1a1", "texto": "A tres mil vueltas, cada cilindro explota veinticinco veces por segundo. ¡Clod, eso no se toca!", "words": [["A", 0.119, 0.2], ["tres", 0.2, 0.44], ["mil", 0.44, 0.68], ["vueltas", 0.68, 1.24], ["cada", 1.319, 1.56], ["cilindro", 1.56, 1.96], ["explota", 1.96, 2.44], ["veinticinco", 2.44, 3.24], ["veces", 3.24, 3.48], ["por", 3.48, 3.72], ["segundo", 3.72, 4.24], ["¡Clod", 4.277, 4.68], ["eso", 4.71, 4.95], ["no", 4.95, 5.11], ["se", 5.19, 5.19], ["toca", 5.19, 5.75]]}, {"at": 33.3, "clip": "clip_0f1c8b2b7fd74cec8870", "texto": "Si notas tirones o el motor tiembla, que te lo revisen. ¿Qué pieza abrimos ahora?", "words": [["Si", 0.115, 0.28], ["notas", 0.28, 0.6], ["tirones", 0.6, 1.16], ["o", 1.16, 1.24], ["el", 1.24, 1.4], ["motor", 1.4, 1.72], ["tiembla", 1.72, 2.12], ["que", 2.2, 2.28], ["te", 2.28, 2.44], ["lo", 2.44, 2.52], ["revisen", 2.52, 3.16], ["¿Qué", 3.278, 3.28], ["pieza", 3.28, 3.6], ["abrimos", 3.6, 4.0], ["ahora", 4.0, 4.32]]}]}